# r1106spf boot 1: reruns that had no earlier batch (written from the queue rows).
pace 1

## SQ-GFB-01 | generated falling blocks mixins
bootreject (?i)(FallingBlockHold|ProtoChunkTicksFalling|HolderReferenceUnbound).*(error|fail)
bootreject (?i)Mixin.*(error|fail).*(FallingBlock|ProtoChunk)

## SQ-CFR-01 | campfire rain mixin applies once, from Delight
shell grep -c "CampfireRainMixin" logs/debug.log; grep -n "CampfireRainMixin" logs/debug.log | head -3; grep -niE "campfire.*(error|exception)|InvalidInjection" logs/latest.log | head
bootreject (?i)campfire.*(InvalidInjection|exception)
look one apply, from creativedelight.mixins.json

## SQ-CFR-08 | damage tags: creativedelight:stoves
bootexpect \[damage-tags\] loaded.*creativedelight:stoves\(1\)
bootreject neither a built-in flag tag nor defined by any pack.*creativedelight:stoves

## SQ-STN-05 | station containers list
bootreject (?i)exception.*StationContainers
shell grep "\[stations\]" logs/latest.log | head

