waitlog \[tcprobe\] done 60
expect \[tcprobe\] done: 0 fail
> forge tags minecraft:fluid get forge:experience
look one fluid (Create liquid experience); no Cycle, Stockpile, Recovery: checked in the enchanting dumps (compare.py)

