## SQ-CFR-05 | rain douses an open-sky campfire on stone only
> fill 90 -61 -40 100 -61 -30 minecraft:stone
> setblock 90 -60 -40 minecraft:campfire[lit=true]
> setblock 93 -61 -40 minecraft:coal_block
> setblock 93 -60 -40 minecraft:campfire[lit=true]
> setblock 96 -60 -40 minecraft:soul_campfire[lit=true]
> setblock 99 -60 -40 minecraft:campfire[lit=true]
> fill 98 -57 -41 100 -57 -39 minecraft:stone
> weather rain
sleep 11
> execute if block 90 -60 -40 minecraft:campfire[lit=false]
> execute if block 93 -60 -40 minecraft:campfire[lit=true]
> execute if block 96 -60 -40 minecraft:soul_campfire[lit=true]
> execute if block 99 -60 -40 minecraft:campfire[lit=true]
count Test passed == 4
> execute if block -25 -60 -35 minecraft:campfire[lit=false]
> weather clear
look the fixture campfire (open sky, grass) also out: SQ-SPF-81 thunder half

## SQ-CFR-07 | comfort near a campfire (default config)
> setblock 90 -60 -20 minecraft:campfire[lit=true]
> effect clear qa
> tp qa 92 -60 -20
sleep 3
> data get entity qa ActiveEffects
expect farmersdelight:comfort|Id:
> tp qa 96 -60 -20
> effect clear qa
sleep 7
> data get entity qa ActiveEffects
> tp qa -20 -60 -24
look near: comfort 3 to 5 s left; far: none

